{"seq":3,"slug":"sets","title":"集合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/state-based/sets","wordCount":1558,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"集合\">集合</h1><p>集合是 CRDT 里冲突最丰富的练兵场，因为它同时支持「加」和「删」，而这两个操作一旦并发就立刻打架：副本 A 删除元素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的同时，副本 B 又添加了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，合并后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 到底该不该在？不同的回答催生了一整谱系的集合 CRDT，从最简单的只增 G-Set，到 2P-Set、OR-Set、LWW-Set。它们都建立在 <a href=\"cvrdt-semilattice\">状态 CRDT 与半格</a> 的半格机器之上，但各自对「加删并发」给出了不同的语义裁决。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>加删并发</strong>：集合同时支持「加」与「删」，副本 A 删 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的同时副本 B 又加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，合并后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 该不该在——这是集合 CRDT 的全部张力来源。</li>\n<li><strong>唯一标签（tag / dot）</strong>：给每次添加打一个全局唯一标识（通常是 <code>(副本ID, 序号)</code>），使「这一次添加」与「那个值」区分开。</li>\n<li><strong>只删已观察（observed-remove）</strong>：删除只移除「我亲眼见过的那些添加」对应的标签，而不是删掉值本身。</li>\n<li><strong>add-wins / remove-wins</strong>：并发加删的两种裁决；OR-Set 通过「只删已观察标签」自然得到 add-wins，2P-Set 则武断地 remove-wins。</li>\n<li><strong>墓碑集</strong>：删除不能真删、需保留标记，否则并发加删无法正确合并；墓碑只增不减是其固有代价。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"g-set-与-2p-set\">G-Set 与 2P-Set</h2><p>**G-Set（Grow-only Set）**最简单：只能加不能删，状态就是元素集合，合并取并集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∪</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cup</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∪</span></span></span></span></span>，查询即成员判定。它直接就是 <a href=\"cvrdt-semilattice\">状态 CRDT 与半格</a> 里的「幂集并半格」，底元素是空集。没有删除就没有冲突，干净但受限。</p>\n<p>要支持删除，**2P-Set（Two-Phase Set）**的朴素做法是再加一个「墓碑集」<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>：删除 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 就把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 放进 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，成员判定为「在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 里且不在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 里」。两个集合都只增，合并各自取并，仍是半格。但它有两个致命缺陷：其一，元素一旦删除就永久进墓碑，<strong>再也加不回来</strong>；其二，当「加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>」与「删 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>」并发时，2P-Set 武断地让「删」赢（墓碑优先），用户刚加的东西凭空消失。这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/why-crdts\">为什么需要 CRDT</a> 里购物车例子要避免的丢更新。</p>\n<h2 id=\"or-set-用唯一标签破局\">OR-Set：用唯一标签破局</h2><p>OR-Set（Observed-Remove Set）是工程上最常用的集合 CRDT，它的洞察是：删除应该只删「我亲眼见过的那些添加」，而不是删掉这个「值」本身。实现办法是给每次添加打一个全局唯一的标签（tag，通常是 <code>(副本ID, 序号)</code> 这样的 dot）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>添加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></strong>：生成一个新唯一标签 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x, t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 放进添加集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>删除 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></strong>：把当前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 中所有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 对应的标签收集起来，放进移除集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>（即只移除「已观察到的」标签）。</li>\n<li><strong>成员判定</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>set</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x \\in \\text{set} \\iff</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6391em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">set</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span></span></span></span> 存在某个标签 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,t) \\in A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t \\notin R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span></span><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"llap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>合并</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 各自取并。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关键就在「删除只针对已观察到的标签」：当副本 B 添加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>（产生新标签 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）与副本 A 删除 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>（只移除它见过的旧标签 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）并发时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不在 A 的移除集里，合并后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x, t_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 依然有效——<strong>add-wins，添加胜出</strong>，用户新加的元素得以保留。这套唯一标签机制和 <a href=\"../foundations/eventual-consistency\">最终一致性与收敛</a> 里向量时钟区分并发的思路一脉相承，也是 <a href=\"../op-based/maps-registers\">映射与寄存器</a> 里 OR-Map 的底层。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  ADD[&quot;add(x)&quot;] --&gt; T[&quot;生成唯一标签 t&lt;br/&gt;放入 A: (x, t)&quot;]&#10;  RM[&quot;remove(x)&quot;] --&gt; OBS[&quot;收集已见的 x 标签&lt;br/&gt;放入 R&quot;]&#10;  T --&gt; Q{&quot;x ∈ set?&quot;}&#10;  OBS --&gt; Q&#10;  Q --&gt;|&quot;存在 t: (x,t)∈A 且 t∉R&quot;| YES[&quot;在集合中&quot;]&#10;  Q --&gt;|否则| NO[&quot;不在集合中&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  ADD[\"add(x)\"] --&gt; T[\"生成唯一标签 t&lt;br/&gt;放入 A: (x, t)\"]\n  RM[\"remove(x)\"] --&gt; OBS[\"收集已见的 x 标签&lt;br/&gt;放入 R\"]\n  T --&gt; Q{\"x ∈ set?\"}\n  OBS --&gt; Q\n  Q --&gt;|\"存在 t: (x,t)∈A 且 t∉R\"| YES[\"在集合中\"]\n  Q --&gt;|否则| NO[\"不在集合中\"]</pre><h2 id=\"lww-set-用时间戳决胜\">LWW-Set：用时间戳决胜</h2><p>LWW-Set（Last-Write-Wins Set）换一种裁决思路：每个元素的「加」与「删」各带一个时间戳，谁的时间戳更新谁说了算。状态是两个映射——「元素 → 最近添加时间」和「元素 → 最近删除时间」。成员判定为「添加时间 ≥ 删除时间」（平局时按约定，通常 add-wins 或 remove-wins）。合并时两个映射对每个键取较大时间戳，这正是 <a href=\"cvrdt-semilattice\">状态 CRDT 与半格</a> 提到的「键到 max 半格的映射」。</p>\n<p>LWW-Set 实现简单、状态比 OR-Set 紧凑（每元素两个时间戳，而非一堆标签），但它继承了 LWW 的老毛病：依赖时钟，时钟回拨或漂移会导致并发写中「错误的一方」获胜，且并发的加删只能留一个、另一个静默丢失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一次并发加删的合并走一遍\">一次并发加删的合并走一遍</h2><p>把 OR-Set 的 add-wins 落到具体字节上。副本 A 与副本 B 初始都持有 <code>{(x, t1)}</code>（元素 x 带标签 t1），随后并发操作：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>副本 A</th>\n<th>副本 B</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>初始</td>\n<td>A={(x,t1)}, R={}</td>\n<td>A={(x,t1)}, R={}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地操作</td>\n<td>remove(x)：把已见的 t1 放入 R</td>\n<td>add(x)：生成新标签 t2，A 加 (x,t2)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>操作后</td>\n<td>A={(x,t1)}, R={t1}</td>\n<td>A={(x,t1),(x,t2)}, R={}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并（A∪、R∪）</td>\n<td>A={(x,t1),(x,t2)}, R={t1}</td>\n<td>同左</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成员判定</td>\n<td>t2 不在 R 中 → x 在集合里</td>\n<td>同左</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键就在最后一行：副本 A 的删除只移除了它「亲眼见过」的 t1，而副本 B 并发添加产生的 t2 从未进入任何移除集，于是合并后 x 凭 t2 存活——add-wins 不是一条特判规则，而是「只删已观察标签」这一设计的自然结果。若换成 2P-Set，x 会被墓碑永久压制，用户的添加凭空消失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四种集合对比\">四种集合对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>集合</th>\n<th>支持删除</th>\n<th>可重新添加</th>\n<th>加删并发裁决</th>\n<th>额外元数据</th>\n<th>信任时钟</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>G-Set</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>无冲突</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2P-Set</td>\n<td>是（一次性）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>remove-wins</td>\n<td>墓碑集</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OR-Set</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>add-wins</td>\n<td>每添加一个唯一标签</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LWW-Set</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>时间戳大者赢</td>\n<td>每元素两个时间戳</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选型经验：要正确语义且不信任时钟，选 OR-Set（代价是标签元数据，需配合垃圾回收，见 <a href=\"../practice/pitfalls-tradeoffs\">陷阱与权衡</a>）；能容忍 LWW 语义且追求紧凑状态，选 LWW-Set；只增不删，G-Set 足矣；2P-Set 多作教学，生产中几乎被 OR-Set 取代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>集合 CRDT 的全部张力来自「加删并发」：删 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 与加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 同时发生，该留谁。</li>\n<li>G-Set 只增无冲突；2P-Set 用墓碑支持删除但元素删后不可复活、且 remove-wins 会吞掉并发添加。</li>\n<li>OR-Set 给每次添加打唯一标签、删除只针对已观察标签，实现 add-wins 且可重新添加，是生产首选。</li>\n<li>LWW-Set 用时间戳决胜，状态紧凑但依赖时钟、并发取舍会丢一方。</li>\n<li>OR-Set 的唯一标签思想直通 <a href=\"../op-based/maps-registers\">映射与寄存器</a> 的 OR-Map；标签膨胀问题留给 <a href=\"../practice/pitfalls-tradeoffs\">陷阱与权衡</a>。换「传操作」视角看同类问题，见 <a href=\"../op-based/cmrdt-commutative\">操作 CRDT 与交换性</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"集合","id":"集合"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"G-Set 与 2P-Set","id":"g-set-与-2p-set"},{"level":2,"text":"OR-Set：用唯一标签破局","id":"or-set-用唯一标签破局"},{"level":2,"text":"LWW-Set：用时间戳决胜","id":"lww-set-用时间戳决胜"},{"level":2,"text":"一次并发加删的合并走一遍","id":"一次并发加删的合并走一遍"},{"level":2,"text":"四种集合对比","id":"四种集合对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"计数器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/state-based/counters"},"next":{"title":"操作 CRDT 与交换性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/op-based/cmrdt-commutative"}}